special.NOTES:
These tags are found in a separate IFD of JPEG, TIFF, DCR and KDC images
from some older Kodak models such as the DC50, DC120, DCS760C, DCS Pro 14N,
14nx, SLR/n, Pro Back and Canon EOS D2000.

fields.ValueConv:
my @a = split ' ',$val;
foreach (@a) {
    $_ = 2048 / $_ if $_;
}
return join ' ', @a;
